# SEO Services Directory

This directory contains all the core services for the programmatic SEO implementation:

- `routeCombinationValidator.ts` - Validates route combinations
- `contentGenerator.ts` - Generates unique content for pages
- `metadataGenerator.ts` - Generates SEO metadata
- `sitemapGenerator.ts` - Generates XML sitemaps
- `indexabilityController.ts` - Controls page indexability
- `internalLinkingEngine.ts` - Manages internal linking
